                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>For more information about partnering with AbbVie,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/partnership-approach-brochure.pdf&quot;>download our brochure&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </par_11>
                        <par_13
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="wcm/foundation/components/parsys">
                            <title
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T12:55:15.469-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T17:44:01.468-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="Our approach: Creating partnerships that make a difference"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"/>
                            <text
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T12:56:00.281-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:00.695-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>At AbbVie, we partner to achieve two important outcomes: to deliver innovative medicines and to make a remarkable impact on people’s lives.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>We start with a highly integrated approach to developing and sustaining our partnerships. We work as one connected unit with a commitment to establishing collaborations across the development continuum that will ultimately benefit patients and fuel scientific progress.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Our goal is to create long-term mutually beneficial relationships. With a shared vision as our foundation, we align our collective capabilities in service of a joint mission to bring innovative medicines that solve serious health issues today and address the medical challenges of tomorrow.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>From start to finish, we ensure that everyone from working teams through senior leadership is aware of and invested in nurturing the assets we develop together. We manage for success—from early identification and mitigation of risks to shared accountability and reward for successful outcomes.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <separator
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756423318]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:17.451-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:17.451-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <title_copy
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T12:55:15.469-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:54.000-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="How we work together"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"/>
                            <text_259153141
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-17T14:03:15.858-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-06-02T11:24:21.219-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;b>Search and Evaluation&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>We focus on identifying and evaluating new opportunities that complement and enhance&amp;nbsp; our existing internal innovation strategies. S&amp;amp;E works in close partnership with our R&amp;amp;D&amp;nbsp; and commercial teams, BD&amp;amp;A and Ventures&amp;nbsp; to thoughtfully address each opportunity.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Business Development and Acquisitions&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>We evaluate a variety of partnership structures to meet the needs of both parties. BD&amp;amp;A works closely with S&amp;amp;E,&amp;nbsp; and our commercial and R&amp;amp;D organizations&amp;nbsp; to evaluate new opportunities.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Global Alliances&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>Highly successful partnerships result from an ongoing commitment to realize a shared vision. At AbbVie, we have a dedicated team that is involved in all aspects of the partnership from contracting through commercialization.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>AbbVie Ventures&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;/b>We strategically invest in transformational scientific opportunities to augment our core R&amp;amp;D interests and gain access to next-generation science and proven scientific leaders. Our expertise in drug development and commercialization can be a valuable resource to even the earliest stage companies.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <separator_copy
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756423318]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:17.451-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:17.451-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <separator_copy_1916185142
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756423318]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:17.451-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:13:17.451-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <title_copy_copy
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T12:55:15.469-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:58:48.988-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="The partnerships team"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"/>
                            <text_1185168660_copy
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T13:14:02.289-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-04T13:59:00.677-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Our team is ready to meet with you to share our capabilities and discuss your business opportunities. We are always looking for innovation and new partnership opportunities that align with our focus areas. With offices in the Northern California, Chicago and Boston areas, as well as other locations around the world, we look forward to hearing from you.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;a href=&quot;https://abbvie.partneringplace.com/SubmissionUI/abbvie/submission&quot;>Contact us&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to submit your idea.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <separator_2123790112
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-05T10:19:42.072-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:19:42.072-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <title_2048351104_cop_854970822
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-05T10:19:52.308-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:35:03.567-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="Areas of interest"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"/>
                            <text_1185168660_copy_398457286
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-01-04T13:14:02.289-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T17:40:11.407-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Our core R&amp;amp;D areas of interest include immunology, oncology, neuroscience, eye care and aesthetics complemented by additional focus areas such as virology and cystic fibrosis. We discover and develop new drugs in therapeutic areas that we believe will make the most significant impact on the disease and its management.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <accordion_copy_copy_
                                cq:styleIds="[1,8]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2022-12-20T16:08:57.224-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:37:41.681-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/accordion/v2/accordion"
                                heading="Our key focus areas"
                                headingElement="h5"
                                singleExpansion="false">
                                <item_1671570554123
                                    cq:panelTitle="Immunology"
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-12-21T01:25:10.583-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="kumarvx60"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>As leading experts in autoimmune diseases and therapies, AbbVie is focused on developing new medicines to address chronic progressive diseases in the field of immunology. Our programs focus on investigating both targeted oral therapies and biologics. Our areas of interest include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Gastroenterology (Crohn’s disease, ulcerative colitis)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Dermatology (psoriasis, atopic dermatitis, hidradenitis suppurativa)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Rheumatology (RA, PsA, AS, GCA, PMR)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Innate immunity / interferon and TH2 mediated diseases (SLE, systemic sclerosis, Sjögren’s syndrome, DM, eosinophilic diseases)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Select fibrotic conditions (systemic sclerosis, IPF)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <item_1671570557396
                                    cq:panelTitle=" Oncology"
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:42:07.405-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Our goal is to transform the way cancer is treated. AbbVie is committed to discovering and developing therapies that work against the processes that cancer cells need to survive. We are committed to achieving long-term control of hematologic malignancies, and investing to identify and advance promising therapies for solid tumors. Our areas of interest include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Novel and differentiated programs directed towards enhanced tumor cell targeting, oncogenic signaling pathways and immuno-oncology&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Targeted biologics and next generation cell therapies&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Novel approaches to small molecules, including technologies to address hard-to-drug&amp;nbsp; target classes&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <item_1671570603045
                                    cq:panelTitle=" Neuroscience"
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:42:16.755-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Our commitment to preserving the personhood of those living with neurological and psychiatric disorders is unwavering. AbbVie Neuroscience portfolio consists of approved therapies and a robust pipeline in neurological and psychiatric disorders with high unmet need. Our areas of interest include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Disease modification approaches for neurodegenerative diseases, including Alzheimer’s and Parkinson’s disease, and select diseases driven by shared biological pathways&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Psychiatric diseases, including&amp;nbsp; bipolar disorder, bipolar depression, major depressive disorder, generalized anxiety disorder and schizophrenia&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Symptomatic approaches with clinical validation for cognitive and neurobehavioral deficits in Alzheimer’s and Parkinson’s disease&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Migraine&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Spasticity and movement disorders; neurorestoration in multiple sclerosis&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <item_1671570607019
                                    cq:panelTitle=" Eye Care"
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:44:04.293-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Our mission in eye care remains to protect and preserve vision for a better quality of life for the millions of people who experience vision loss every year. AbbVie continues to search for new therapeutics that address unmet needs and new approaches to retina-related diseases, glaucoma, dry eye disease, and refractive conditions. We are focused on both biologics and small molecules, as well as next generation drug delivery technologies. Our areas of interest include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Retinal degeneration, including Dry AMD/geographic atrophy, Wet AMD and diabetic retinal diseases&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Dry eye and ocular surface disease of various etiologies&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Glaucoma, addressing intraocular pressure control and neuroprotection&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Refractive medicine, including presbyopia, myopia and corneal dystrophies&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <item_1672933046685
                                    cq:panelTitle="Aesthetics"
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T10:44:13.177-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Allergan Aesthetics is developing a portfolio of innovative products in the areas of facial and body filling, breast reconstruction/augmentation, and regenerative soft tissue repair. We are interested in strategic collaborations that broaden our understanding of the aging process, and therapeutic&amp;nbsp; targets to address the natural, physical, and biological changes that occur with age. We seek out and partner with strategic collaborators for neurotoxins, dermal fillers, body aesthetics, plastic surgery and regenerative medicine, hair growth, and skin care. We are also interested in exploring the use of energy-based devices for the field of body aesthetics. Cell and gene therapies with a focus on extracellular matrix components including collagen and elastin are also of interest. Our areas of interest include:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Dermal injectables for skin and tissue&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Plastics and regenerative medicine&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Toxins for aesthetic and therapeutics&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Hair growth&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Body contouring and fat reduction&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Topical skin care&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <item_1672933056191
                                    cq:panelTitle="Additional focus areas"
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-01-05T15:50:59.051-05:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="chiucx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>We also selectively focus our attention on other areas where there is unmet need:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Virology&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Cystic fibrosis&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Women’s health&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Platforms and technologies&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                            </accordion_copy_copy_>
                        </par_13>
